<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>VEXO — Coming Soon</title>
  <meta name="description" content="VEXO — nowa marka. Produkty już wkrótce.">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --bg: #07070a;
      --card: #101015;
      --text: #f5f5f7;
      --muted: #9a9aa5;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      --accent: #ffffff;
    }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 15%, rgba(255,255,255,.09), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 85%, rgba(255,255,255,.04), transparent 25%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    nav {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 28px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
    }
    .nav-pill {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 9px 15px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
    }
    main {
      flex: 1;
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 60px 0 90px;
    }
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 850px;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      color: #c8c8d0;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
      margin-bottom: 27px;
    }
    .dot {
      width: 7px; height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255,255,255,.8);
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(70px, 14vw, 170px);
      line-height: .82;
      letter-spacing: -.075em;
      font-weight: 950;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    h1 span { color: #777781; }
    .lead {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px);
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 38px;
    }
    .notify {
      display: flex;
      width: min(470px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 5px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
      border-radius: 15px;
    }
    input {
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1;
      border: 0;
      outline: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: white;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    button {
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #09090b;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 0 19px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform .2s, opacity .2s;
    }
    button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); opacity: .9; }
    .products {
      margin-top: 85px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .product-card {
      min-height: 180px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.055), rgba(255,255,255,.015));
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .product-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 130px; height: 130px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      filter: blur(35px);
    }
    .product-card strong { font-size: 17px; z-index: 1; }
    .product-card small {
      color: #777781;
      z-index: 1;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    footer {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: #6e6e78;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      nav { padding: 20px 0; }
      main { padding-top: 45px; }
      .products { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 55px; }
      .product-card { min-height: 130px; }
      .notify { flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; border: 0; background: transparent; }
      input, button { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; min-height: 48px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
      button { background: white; }
      footer { gap: 10px; flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">VEXO</div>
    <div class="nav-pill">COMING SOON</div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Nowa marka nadchodzi</div>
      <h1>VEXO<span>.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Tworzymy coś nowego. Produkty VEXO są jeszcze w przygotowaniu —
        obserwuj nas, aby być jednym z pierwszych.
      </p>

      <form class="notify" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Dzięki! VEXO da Ci znać, gdy wystartujemy.');">
        <input type="email" placeholder="Twój adres e-mail" aria-label="Adres e-mail" required>
        <button type="submit">Powiadom mnie</button>
      </form>

      <div class="products">
        <div class="product-card">
          <strong>Produkt #01</strong>
          <small>Coming soon</small>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <strong>Produkt #02</strong>
          <small>Coming soon</small>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <strong>Produkt #03</strong>
          <small>Coming soon</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>© 2026 VEXO</span>
    <span>Więcej już wkrótce.</span>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
